      "english": "Seeing the dentist"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "安妮：医生，我每天刷牙，为什么还是牙疼呢？",
      "traditional": "安妮：醫生，我每天刷牙，為什麼還是牙疼呢？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī yī shēng wǒ měi tiān shuā yá wèi shén me hái shi yá téng ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Doctor, I brush my teeth every day. Why do I still have a toothache?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "牙医：你早上和晚上都刷牙吗？",
      "traditional": "牙醫：你早上和晚上都刷牙嗎？",
      "pinyin": "yá yī nǐ zǎo shang hé wǎn shang dōu shuā yá ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dentist: Do you brush your teeth in both the morning and at night?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "安妮：是的，每天早晚都刷。",
      "traditional": "安妮：是的，每天早晚都刷。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī shì de měi tiān zǎo wǎn dōu shuā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Yeah, every morning and night."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "牙医：吃饭以后有没有漱口？",
      "traditional": "牙醫：吃飯以後有沒有漱口？",
      "pinyin": "yá yī chī fàn yǐ hòu yǒu méi yǒu shù kǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dentist: Do you gargle after each meal?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "安妮：有啊。",
      "traditional": "安妮：有啊。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī yǒu a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
