      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Yeah."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "牙医：你是不是爱吃糖？",
      "traditional": "牙醫：你是不是愛吃糖？",
      "pinyin": "yá yī nǐ shì bu shì ài chī táng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dentist: Do you like eating sugar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "安妮：我从来不吃糖。",
      "traditional": "安妮：我從來不吃糖。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ cóng lái bù chī táng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I never eat sugar."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "牙医：太奇怪了……你晚上刷牙以后真的不吃东西吗？",
